WEBVTT

00:03.730 --> 00:07.550
There are ancient elven ruins 
up in Zoltan's mountains.

00:07.550 --> 00:11.680
The girl is a humanoid weapon created there.

00:11.680 --> 00:14.530
You can read more about her in 
that investigation report.

00:15.240 --> 00:19.480
She is not a threat to humanity, 
so there's no reason for us to remain here.

00:19.480 --> 00:20.830
We'll return at once.

00:20.830 --> 00:22.250
I'm afraid I cannot accept that.

00:22.250 --> 00:23.250
And why is that?

00:23.690 --> 00:27.940
Because we must always live 
as our Blessings tell us to.

00:28.400 --> 00:30.250
Mine tells me it's not time to go.

00:32.050 --> 00:34.750
Well, I'm not about to drag you away.

00:35.180 --> 00:38.540
I hope that your Blessing will 
encourage you to begin a new journey.

00:40.520 --> 00:44.770
It appears that Lord Demis has 
given me a trial to overcome.

00:44.770 --> 00:46.020
What trial?

00:46.330 --> 00:48.390
I don't know why...

00:48.390 --> 00:51.420
But my Blessing's impulses, 
which have kept me going all this time,

00:52.720 --> 00:54.230
seem to have completely disappeared.

01:09.250 --> 01:15.960
<b>Banished from the Hero's Party,
I Decided to Live a Quiet Life in the Countryside 2nd</b>

02:26.780 --> 02:30.420
<b>The Hero's
Challenge</b>

02:33.800 --> 02:34.740
Delicious.

02:37.650 --> 02:40.320
The tea you make helps one relax, Red.

02:40.320 --> 02:41.710
Glad to hear it.

02:42.340 --> 02:44.300
So, how's Van looking?

02:45.770 --> 02:49.350
He's been acting strange ever since 
he went on that mission with you.

02:50.080 --> 02:52.990
He holes up in his room all day, praying.

02:52.990 --> 02:54.610
He speaks much less now, too.

02:56.860 --> 02:59.770
We knows what new 
crazy ideas he might get,

02:59.770 --> 03:02.800
so Ljubo and I are taking 
turns checking in on him.

03:02.800 --> 03:04.120
Hello.

03:04.120 --> 03:06.580
Welcome. Is something the matter?

03:06.580 --> 03:08.620
I wanted your opinion on something.

03:08.980 --> 03:13.700
There was a request to look for a 
child who went missing in the forest,

03:13.700 --> 03:18.130
but Miss Ruti and I can't do 
anything lest we run into Van.

03:18.130 --> 03:23.360
Other adventurers won't take the mission 
because they doubt there's foul play involved,

03:23.360 --> 03:24.770
so the Guild is at a loss.

03:24.770 --> 03:26.500
I'll go, then.

03:26.500 --> 03:27.440
Huh?

03:27.440 --> 03:28.560
You sure?

03:28.560 --> 03:30.640
Yeah. Let me handle this.

03:30.880 --> 03:32.140
But...

03:32.380 --> 03:34.320
I used to be a Zoltan adventurer,

03:34.320 --> 03:36.420
so I know my way around the woods here.

03:36.960 --> 03:42.030
And, while I know this won't 
make up for how I used to be,

03:42.030 --> 03:45.160
I want to help this region 
out in any way I can.

03:45.420 --> 03:46.540
Albert...

03:47.300 --> 03:53.840
I'm no hero or champion, 
but I'm traveling with Esta now.

03:53.840 --> 03:57.540
That makes me so happy, and it's 
a constant source of pride for me.

03:57.930 --> 04:02.000
I want to act in a way 
that befits her partner.

04:02.000 --> 04:04.050
I-I'm honored you would feel that way.

04:06.010 --> 04:06.970
What?!

04:06.970 --> 04:09.680
We can trust Albert to handle matters.

04:09.680 --> 04:12.180
Y-Yeah, I suppose so.

04:12.180 --> 04:15.350
Here's all the information 
we have at the moment.

04:15.350 --> 04:17.040
It's up to you now.

04:17.040 --> 04:17.730
Right.

04:43.040 --> 04:46.800
Hey, I'm out. Bring me another bottle.

04:48.480 --> 04:51.470
What do you think you're doing here, Ljubo?

04:51.470 --> 04:53.260
It's you, Esta.

04:53.260 --> 04:55.160
Join me for drinks.

04:55.160 --> 04:58.000
Where's Van? Still at the inn?

04:58.000 --> 05:01.480
No. He went off somewhere on his own.

05:01.750 --> 05:03.370
What do you mean?

05:03.370 --> 05:05.240
I don't know the details.

05:05.600 --> 05:08.490
He heard that a child had gone missing,

05:08.490 --> 05:11.240
so he and Lavender went to search.

05:13.090 --> 05:16.680
He ignores everything I say.

05:16.680 --> 05:21.880
But why? What has gotten into my Hero?

05:23.390 --> 05:26.880
He can still be fixed, though. He has to be.

05:29.920 --> 05:35.020
Was it not the Almighty who 
brought the Hero before me?

05:40.120 --> 05:42.620
I didn't expect to run into 
an ogre in this forest.

05:43.260 --> 05:44.280
I hope the child is all right.

05:50.580 --> 05:51.330
Oops.

05:51.600 --> 05:53.010
Sorry about that.

05:54.000 --> 05:55.820
Kurukururu!

05:56.830 --> 05:59.420
Don't kill him!

05:57.430 --> 05:59.420
I... I'm fine...

05:59.690 --> 06:03.320
Wait, I'm just an adventurer. 
I came looking for you.

06:03.320 --> 06:04.490
For me?

06:04.490 --> 06:09.180
Yeah. Your parents were worried 
you got lost in the woods.

06:09.510 --> 06:11.580
I was playing with Kurukururu.

06:11.580 --> 06:13.660
But then, that monster showed up.

06:14.430 --> 06:16.180
It's all right now.

06:16.180 --> 06:18.440
You kept her safe, did you?

06:18.760 --> 06:21.940
Yeah! Kurukururu protected me!

06:21.940 --> 06:24.290
But there's a scarier one around.

06:24.290 --> 06:25.940
The fay are all afraid!

06:26.280 --> 06:27.020
What?

06:27.020 --> 06:28.700
Found her.

06:29.440 --> 06:30.450
Sir Hero.

06:30.450 --> 06:31.840
Is the child hurt?

06:31.840 --> 06:32.700
No.

06:33.060 --> 06:34.290
That's good.

06:34.700 --> 06:36.730
<i>What's with his oppressive aura?</i>

06:37.260 --> 06:38.750
<i>Something's off about him.</i>

06:39.350 --> 06:41.710
I'll take her home now.

06:41.710 --> 06:43.120
Let's go.

06:43.120 --> 06:45.710
Before that, we need to kill 
the evil that caused all this.

06:46.120 --> 06:48.220
The... evil?

06:48.710 --> 06:51.470
Didn't that thing lure the 
child into the forest?

06:52.040 --> 06:54.090
Evil must be slain.

06:54.930 --> 06:58.100
C-Calm down, Sir Hero.

06:58.100 --> 07:01.190
Fairy dragons aren't malicious monsters.

07:01.190 --> 07:05.150
They're fay, just like Lavender, 
and they're friendly to humans!

07:05.150 --> 07:08.070
You're using me to beg for its life?

07:08.070 --> 07:10.960
Albert. I will wait ten 
seconds for you to move.

07:10.960 --> 07:13.660
If you get in my way, then you 
too are evil and must be slain.

07:16.800 --> 07:19.260
Run! I'll hold them off!

07:19.260 --> 07:20.220
B-But...

07:20.220 --> 07:21.040
Just go!

07:25.360 --> 07:27.420
Do you know that fay?

07:27.880 --> 07:30.130
No. I just met it.

07:30.620 --> 07:33.140
Are you confident that you can defeat me?

07:34.800 --> 07:35.890
Not in the least.

07:35.890 --> 07:38.890
Then why are you throwing your life away?

07:40.630 --> 07:42.310
You're right.

07:42.310 --> 07:44.570
I'm shaking in my boots, to be honest.

07:45.200 --> 07:49.150
But I won't stand back and watch 
you take an innocent life.

07:49.750 --> 07:51.650
And I won't run from this fight!

07:52.220 --> 07:54.160
What is this feeling?

07:54.730 --> 07:59.900
I don't know why, but it seems 
like I wish to kill you.

08:13.480 --> 08:15.050
Lavender, can you track them?

08:15.050 --> 08:16.300
Of course I can!

08:25.800 --> 08:26.730
What are you trying to pull?

08:27.850 --> 08:30.010
Don't... kill it.

08:31.050 --> 08:33.640
Why would you do this for a mere fay?

08:33.640 --> 08:37.740
Because I'm part of the Hero's party.

08:40.350 --> 08:43.460
I want to act in a way that befits that.

08:43.750 --> 08:44.780
Let me go.

08:48.440 --> 08:55.500
Let me go.

08:57.180 --> 09:08.270
Let me go!

09:08.520 --> 09:11.860
I'm the Hero, damn you!

09:23.160 --> 09:24.290
Van!

09:26.040 --> 09:27.210
You fought well.

09:28.830 --> 09:29.960
Regenerate.

09:31.940 --> 09:35.110
Albert, you are a champion.

09:35.760 --> 09:38.430
I am truly proud of you.

09:41.040 --> 09:45.430
Esta, that man stopped me from slaying evil.

09:47.190 --> 09:50.270
Van, do you think I'm in any 
mood for a conversation?

09:50.270 --> 09:51.690
I am...

09:52.000 --> 09:54.050
filled with rage!

10:01.530 --> 10:02.910
Why?

10:02.910 --> 10:05.240
I looked up to you!

10:05.240 --> 10:07.600
<i>Perhaps you've made a grave mistake?</i>

10:08.420 --> 10:09.880
Get away from him!

10:13.950 --> 10:16.550
You say you're mad and 
then fight like a bitch!

10:17.160 --> 10:19.660
And what happened to you?

10:19.660 --> 10:23.180
I thought you never wanted to 
show Van how you really fought.

10:23.180 --> 10:24.710
Shut your mouth.

10:24.710 --> 10:27.850
I've hated you from the 
moment I laid eyes upon you.

10:29.270 --> 10:31.230
Okay, that's quite enough.

10:34.630 --> 10:39.070
What, a lowly water archfay 
thinks she can stop me?

10:39.330 --> 10:42.400
Your anger is ruining your cute little face.

10:42.400 --> 10:44.580
Are you trying to expose yourself?

10:44.580 --> 10:46.180
You're dead!

11:12.060 --> 11:12.960
Van...

11:15.520 --> 11:16.610
Healing Hands.

11:20.520 --> 11:22.950
<i>That girl is within my reach.</i>

11:23.470 --> 11:25.880
<i>Soon, I can...</i>

11:33.760 --> 11:36.040
Will Mr. Adventurer be okay?

11:36.400 --> 11:38.800
His wounds have completely healed.

11:38.800 --> 11:40.970
He's just resting now.

11:42.610 --> 11:46.050
I'm glad the kid made it out 
all right, too. Albert did well.

11:46.760 --> 11:48.810
Do we know if he'll wake up?

11:48.810 --> 11:53.110
Yeah. He pushed himself past 
his limits to deal with Van.

11:53.110 --> 11:55.290
He needs some time to rest.

11:55.290 --> 11:56.310
I see.

11:56.610 --> 11:59.030
It's great that you realized 
what was going on.

12:00.190 --> 12:03.690
I just guessed. I felt something 
dangerous in the air.

12:04.800 --> 12:06.780
Van's out of control.

12:06.780 --> 12:10.010
The impulses of the Hero's 
Blessings are very strong.

12:10.010 --> 12:13.790
Normally, it wouldn't let 
you fight emotionally.

12:14.350 --> 12:18.310
He must so confused that it's 
repressing his Blessing's impulses.

12:19.020 --> 12:20.800
I've experienced that before.

12:21.270 --> 12:24.610
He must be panicking at how he's wavering.

12:25.200 --> 12:28.560
My goal was to change his mentality, 
but I wasn't expecting this.

12:28.810 --> 12:30.420
It's not your fault.

12:30.860 --> 12:34.560
The responsibility lies with us, the people 
who have spent so much time with him.

12:34.880 --> 12:35.730
Esta.

12:37.860 --> 12:39.940
Let me go cool off.

12:45.300 --> 12:46.320
Big Brother.

12:46.550 --> 12:47.190
I know.

12:57.520 --> 13:02.250
For the first time in my life, 
I let my anger take over.

13:03.080 --> 13:05.730
When I saw Albert on the verge of death, I...

13:05.730 --> 13:07.760
You couldn't stop yourself?

13:07.760 --> 13:11.760
I was terrified of losing him.

13:12.430 --> 13:15.770
Even now, the very thought 
drives a stake into my heart.

13:16.580 --> 13:22.060
And I once tried to kill you in order 
to keep Ruti fighting as our Hero.

13:22.660 --> 13:24.780
I've changed so much, 
and that scares me most of all.

13:25.900 --> 13:28.700
I might eventually make 
the wrong decision again.

13:29.280 --> 13:33.300
I may lose myself and do 
something irrevocable.

13:34.210 --> 13:35.790
And that frightens me.

13:36.300 --> 13:39.290
Are you going to cast aside 
your feelings for Albert, then?

13:45.630 --> 13:46.590
No...

13:47.830 --> 13:49.300
I can't.

13:50.460 --> 13:52.120
I don't want to.

13:53.130 --> 13:54.850
Then that's, fine.

13:55.500 --> 13:58.000
Those emotions don't come 
from your Blessing,

13:58.000 --> 14:00.390
but from deep within your heart.

14:01.080 --> 14:03.820
And I think that's really worth something.

14:04.830 --> 14:07.820
Emotions that have nothing to 
do with our Blessings, huh...

14:10.590 --> 14:15.930
Meeting you people has turned me 
into a terrible woman of faith.

14:16.450 --> 14:17.960
Red. Esta.

14:34.530 --> 14:35.430
Who's there?

14:35.950 --> 14:37.930
Cardinal Ljubo, it's me.

14:37.930 --> 14:42.080
O-Oh, Van. Come in.

14:44.010 --> 14:47.690
I came to let you know that 
I'm leaving Zoltan.

14:47.690 --> 14:51.440
Y-You are? You finally understand!

14:51.440 --> 14:53.110
Let us prepare to leave at once!

14:53.110 --> 14:56.070
But first, I'm going to head 
to the Undine's dwelling.

14:56.070 --> 14:56.910
What?

14:57.230 --> 14:59.570
And I'll kill all the fay there.

14:59.570 --> 15:01.880
I think Esta, Gideon, 
and others will be there, as well,

15:01.880 --> 15:03.360
and I'm going to kill them all.

15:03.360 --> 15:05.920
What are you talking about?

15:06.220 --> 15:09.670
That's sure to draw the girl out, 
and I'll kill her.

15:10.160 --> 15:13.680
If she doesn't show, 
I'll destroy Zoltan until she does.

15:13.970 --> 15:15.700
Settle down, Van.

15:15.700 --> 15:20.260
You are the Hero. You must act like one.

15:23.470 --> 15:24.440
Van...

15:25.580 --> 15:26.620
Why?

15:28.160 --> 15:31.350
I don't feel the impulses of 
the Hero's Blessing anymore.

15:31.350 --> 15:35.100
My Blessing doesn't tell me 
what I need to do as the Hero.

15:35.500 --> 15:36.200
As such...

15:36.640 --> 15:39.180
I'll carry out the last impulse 
my Blessing gave me...

15:39.180 --> 15:43.580
I'll kill that girl and all the 
evil that stands in my way.

15:44.680 --> 15:46.480
Wai...

15:54.230 --> 15:55.760
Van will be here soon.

15:56.330 --> 15:58.610
Lavender will no doubt be with him.

15:58.610 --> 16:01.770
I can't stop that fairy alone.

16:02.170 --> 16:05.110
She's stronger than a water archfay?

16:05.110 --> 16:07.580
What exactly is Lavender?

16:08.240 --> 16:12.150
I didn't want to out her,

16:12.150 --> 16:14.570
but I guess it's too late for that now.

16:16.490 --> 16:19.200
She's a calamity.

16:19.200 --> 16:20.560
A what?

16:20.560 --> 16:23.410
She's one of the archfay Ketu.

16:23.410 --> 16:26.160
Avatars of power and destruction.

16:26.160 --> 16:30.420
They've wreaked havoc like natural disasters 
since this planet came into existence.

16:30.750 --> 16:35.040
As civilization advanced, the ancient 
elves and dragons wiped the Ketu out,

16:35.040 --> 16:37.140
leaving her the sole survivor.

16:37.600 --> 16:41.430
I'd thought she was living 
in hiding, deep in a jungle...

16:41.790 --> 16:45.940
We've gone past legendary and 
into mythical territory here...

16:46.300 --> 16:47.940
So, what's our plan?

16:47.940 --> 16:52.690
A mythical archfay and the Hero, the ultimate 
human, are on their way to attack us.

16:52.690 --> 16:55.950
This will probably be our last 
chance to talk things out with Van.

16:55.950 --> 16:59.700
Talk things out? 
I don't think that's possible.

16:59.970 --> 17:02.190
Yeah, there's no avoiding a battle.

17:02.630 --> 17:05.460
But unlike how Van used to be, 
I think we stand a good chance.

17:05.750 --> 17:08.210
But we just talked about 
how he's out of control.

17:08.440 --> 17:10.870
Yeah, he's out of control.

17:10.870 --> 17:13.310
The Hero, who never wavers, is wavering now.

17:13.840 --> 17:16.470
My words should be able
 to get through to him.

17:16.470 --> 17:18.970
I can change his extreme views.

17:18.970 --> 17:21.280
I believe in Red.

17:21.280 --> 17:23.820
I'll back him up if it comes down to it.

17:23.820 --> 17:26.710
So please let him handle this.

17:26.710 --> 17:28.980
If you two say so...

17:29.340 --> 17:32.480
So, how exactly do you 
intend to go about this?

17:33.040 --> 17:35.740
By settling things one-on-one with Van.

17:35.740 --> 17:37.990
You want to fight Van one-on-one?

17:37.990 --> 17:39.870
That's crazy.

17:40.200 --> 17:43.450
Van's strong, and there are 
no guarantees in battle.

17:43.450 --> 17:46.050
So I can't say I'll win for sure, but...

17:46.830 --> 17:47.870
I'll win.

17:51.650 --> 17:55.610
I'll put up a field to minimize the damage.

17:55.610 --> 17:57.380
Would any of you be willing to help me out?

17:57.800 --> 17:59.260
I can.

17:59.560 --> 18:01.380
I'll help, too.

18:01.380 --> 18:04.270
I would also like someone 
to help defend the village.

18:04.270 --> 18:07.260
Mr. Crawly Wawly and I will see to it.

18:08.540 --> 18:10.830
Okay, I'm counting on you all.

18:10.830 --> 18:12.270
Now for the finishing touches.

18:12.800 --> 18:14.410
Yeah!

18:22.120 --> 18:23.160
Good luck,

18:25.020 --> 18:25.870
Big Brother.

18:30.530 --> 18:31.500
Thanks.

18:33.280 --> 18:34.640
I finally get to see you again.

18:35.510 --> 18:39.010
I know I can go back to being 
a Hero once I kill you.

18:58.710 --> 19:01.570
Gideon, I can tell.

19:02.260 --> 19:04.580
She's Ruti the Hero, isn't she?

19:05.530 --> 19:08.580
This is the destiny 
Lord Demis has laid out for me.

19:09.120 --> 19:13.880
In order to become the true Hero, 
I must defeat the old one.

19:14.480 --> 19:17.420
Inheriting Ruti the Hero's power,

19:17.420 --> 19:19.880
Van the Hero will save the world!

19:19.880 --> 19:21.540
That's stretching it.

19:22.640 --> 19:25.510
You don't know what to do anymore,

19:25.510 --> 19:28.600
so you're forcibly assigning significance 
to random happenings around you.

19:28.600 --> 19:30.200
That's not true!

19:30.200 --> 19:33.760
Isn't it? 
What's your Hero's Blessing telling you?

19:33.760 --> 19:35.860
It's telling me to kill Ruti!

19:36.170 --> 19:39.360
You're not actually feeling 
that impulse at all, are you?

19:41.640 --> 19:43.700
This only started after I spoke to you.

19:44.380 --> 19:46.010
Wavering is painful.

19:46.490 --> 19:49.330
I feel like I'm losing myself.

19:49.330 --> 19:52.330
Everyone doubts themselves 
at some point in life.

19:52.330 --> 19:54.240
The Hero never wavers.

19:54.240 --> 19:55.880
It is not allowed!

19:55.880 --> 19:57.420
I did.

19:58.290 --> 20:01.790
I did so over and over while 
fighting the demon lord's army.

20:02.360 --> 20:04.650
I worried if I was 
doing the right thing.

20:04.650 --> 20:08.060
I wasn't sure if I should trust my judgment, 
and regretted plenty of things I did.

20:09.280 --> 20:12.000
In particular, 
after Big Brother left the party,

20:12.000 --> 20:14.530
I didn't know what to believe anymore.

20:15.040 --> 20:18.570
At some point, I was distancing myself 
from the people I could trust.

20:19.530 --> 20:22.670
And yet, they're helping me out now.

20:23.310 --> 20:24.570
After all this time,

20:25.660 --> 20:29.580
I finally truly believe that 
we've become an actual party.

20:29.580 --> 20:30.760
I don't believe you!

20:30.760 --> 20:32.250
A Hero never wavers!

20:32.250 --> 20:34.580
That is the role assigned by the Almighty!

20:34.580 --> 20:36.080
Quit running, Van!

20:37.210 --> 20:39.370
If you truly want to be the Hero,

20:39.370 --> 20:41.550
quit running from the doubts you have.

20:41.550 --> 20:43.470
Muster up the courage to face them.

20:43.470 --> 20:44.600
Courage?

20:44.600 --> 20:45.650
That's right.

20:45.650 --> 20:47.540
No matter how painful things might get,

20:47.540 --> 20:49.730
stand your ground and walk 
the path you choose.

20:49.730 --> 20:51.470
That's what you call courage.

20:51.920 --> 20:54.990
A Hero is completely immune to fear.

20:54.990 --> 20:56.860
Isn't that good enough?

20:56.860 --> 21:00.230
As the Guide, allow me to show you the way.

21:03.030 --> 21:05.440
Fight me. Grab that sword.

21:06.110 --> 21:07.730
A bronze sword?

21:07.730 --> 21:10.720
This is a battle between 
the Hero and the Guide.

21:10.720 --> 21:13.120
Try besting me, Van.

21:13.120 --> 21:15.740
That should clear your doubts.

21:21.260 --> 21:22.460
I understand.

21:23.280 --> 21:25.380
Don't let him fool you, Van!

21:25.380 --> 21:27.000
Stand back, Lavender.

21:27.000 --> 21:29.070
Back off! I'll kill you!

21:29.070 --> 21:32.140
We have no right to stop them.

21:32.140 --> 21:33.910
Shut your mouth!

21:33.910 --> 21:38.400
Anyone who gets in the way of my love 
deserves to die a miserable death!

21:38.650 --> 21:41.570
And I won't let anyone 
mess with my love, either!

21:41.570 --> 21:45.400
It doesn't matter if it's a mythical fay, 
the Hero, or even the Almighty.

21:45.400 --> 21:49.410
Interfere, and I will cut you down!

21:51.240 --> 21:54.960
We'll stop our swords at the last second, 
and the loser will admit defeat...

21:54.960 --> 21:58.210
I really hope that's not how 
you think this is going to go.

21:58.440 --> 22:02.960
Of course not. We're fighting 
until one of us goes down.

22:02.960 --> 22:04.710
Excellent!

22:04.710 --> 22:08.940
Because I can't stop until 
I unleash all of this anger on you!
